        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The website www.prayerwalking.ca was created to log prayerwalking routes.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "product",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The website allows users to see what part of their community has been prayed through.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "innovation",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ed Silvoso believes that prayer can change the spiritual climate in communities.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project envisions prayerwalking every street in the community every month.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy"
      ],
      "type": "pipeline",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "www.prayerwalking.ca is a website that allows users to log their prayerwalking routes and see what part of their community has been prayed through.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "As time passes, the logged prayerwalking routes on www.prayerwalking.ca get lighter, indicating how recently they have been prayed through.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "If a community is sponsored, everyone can see the state of the prayer canopy over that community in real time.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The prayerwalking tool has received a great response since its launch in August.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The smartphone app will allow users to track their prayerwalking routes automatically and upload them to the website.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "strategy",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "market",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The goal is to complete the app development by next summer.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The app is expected to take about 3 months to develop and go through initial debugging.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "After the initial debugging, another 3 months will be needed for more thorough debugging through actual trials.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An Android app will be available shortly after the iPhone app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives",
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "milestone",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pledging $50 or more will result in receiving a copy of the book 'Beginnings – growing in prayer through Genesis'.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pledging $100 or more will result in receiving a signed copy of the book.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt74__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pledging $250 or more will result in the community being put on the site after the campaign ends.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
